<body>
    <h1>4th Year Project - Guidelines for Final Project Documentation</h1>
    <div class=3D"Section1">
        <p local-id=3D"8ea399c2b17a">Below are guidelines for producing the=
 final 4th year project documentation to help assist in preparation of the =
material. The document should be in two sections:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"b89252a2e7e0">
<li local-id=3D"67915d0b52c4">
<p local-id=3D"b526a6e1de24"><strong>Project Overview Document</strong>: Th=
is should provide a high level description of all aspects of the project. O=
ne document should be produced per project.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"8ad5b83bdff4">
<p local-id=3D"a2e5a1cb4f97"><strong>Personal Contribution Document</strong=
>: This should provide details of student=E2=80=99s individual contribution=
. Each student should complete this section individually.</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"d2fdebb457c7">The project is ultimately assessed as an indiv=
idual project, and the documentation should reflect the effort and learning=
 outcomes achieved by the individual student. This will be assessed in a co=
nsistent way against Learning Outcomes, whether the project was undertaken =
as a team or individually.</p>
<p local-id=3D"95d14cd930de">The final document is worth 45% of the overall=
 project mark. The presentation is worth 10%.</p>
<h2 local-id=3D"47840f384f11" id=3D"id-4thYearProject-GuidelinesforFinalPro=
jectDocumentation-ProjectOverviewDocument(20%)"><u>Project Overview Documen=
t (20%)</u></h2>
<p local-id=3D"2b5c52c617c4">This document should be completed for each pro=
ject. It should provide the reader an understanding of the architecture, de=
sign, processes, tooling and functionality of the platform and application.=
 This can be an update to any similar documentation produced for the stage =
1 submission.</p>
<p local-id=3D"7c5bf4635a69">The document should outline of the following a=
spects of the project, including diagrams and screenshots to help illustrat=
e the topics.</p>
<ul local-id=3D"b7058835-1f50-4e02-b2c5-363a14ecb15d">
<li local-id=3D"b482bcf4-c5bb-4688-9316-487e5c81c00a">
<p local-id=3D"d1833590ff8c">Pipeline</p>
<ul local-id=3D"4e885153-0c34-404e-9c7c-956f5a29b079">
<li local-id=3D"780e25a6-33d7-4451-b47d-295e2e050a21">
<p local-id=3D"df882e13627f">Structured</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"6980ab3e-e379-4bd2-ad60-b9963791d76e">
<p local-id=3D"c7fd9c8d7449">CI automation</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"fa11df89-21c5-42ca-bf76-3e0f4edc55dd">
<p local-id=3D"55c431ffa56e">Automated Testing approach</p>
<ul local-id=3D"9904869e-c6ae-4f15-a00b-6a94a2af63a7">
<li local-id=3D"7b8cb9c9-4252-404d-af7d-b23a5b657aff">
<p local-id=3D"de68cbcdc1f3">Unit testing</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"fbf29965-f356-41b4-853a-41e28bea79cb">
<p local-id=3D"78dc6f221445">system</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"28e2c47e-8c62-42ba-95a2-f9f7496bacf4">
<p local-id=3D"0daeada03440">Non functional (including security)</p></li>
</ul></li>
</ul></li>
<li local-id=3D"35431553-bf95-4626-a158-464a3d4166d6">
<p local-id=3D"59aa8c58b8c4">Environment</p>
<ul local-id=3D"196c3547-bff0-406c-a639-f60604fe9fa6">
<li local-id=3D"37486168-359c-4feb-b509-38ce95b65513">
<p local-id=3D"3c8f49d087dd">Multiple Environments (test/prod)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"6d7d09b8-bc2c-452a-8ffb-7f8a47966270">
<p local-id=3D"1d6657489287">Provisioning of environments</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"05c98f5e-3f1b-48ed-94d7-f97f7d147327">
<p local-id=3D"0a6f8465c0b0">Resilience</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"474669a5-4bad-4750-b523-6bcb7d95a174">
<p local-id=3D"7306e74bed16">Appropriate security features</p></li>
</ul></li>
<li local-id=3D"9ce24854-f578-4508-b73c-560af2b7cc98">
<p local-id=3D"ec19c79988c5">Deployment</p>
<ul local-id=3D"02c29521-6b6d-4cbc-ac52-22547e884a90">
<li local-id=3D"b515e247-a6da-4677-8831-8d2b5d70dd55">
<p local-id=3D"f4420c8aa650">Automated deployment process</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"221ec90a-4276-4074-8294-27a1104d6c94">
<p local-id=3D"50805e82e3a0">Deployment strategy</p>
<ul local-id=3D"6d038d1a-e4df-40d7-aae5-b9d7bc1f0fd1">
<li local-id=3D"897d942d-4e25-4df5-9c17-51c26c8a1362">
<p local-id=3D"d45f7ee33dad">Mechanism e.g. feature switch, green/blue etc.=
</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"3623c21a-a883-4afd-99a9-0fc488ee9776">
<p local-id=3D"76b70d85497d">Controlled Release management process</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"9b0dc852-8984-4e91-a35c-2cb6e1c2f58f">
<p local-id=3D"e611141d070d">Deployment tooling and automation</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"30aaaeb0-990e-4550-a15a-e8561e1c9fc2">
<p local-id=3D"6ee933a040c8">Release strategy e.g. canary etc.</p></li>
</ul></li>
</ul></li>
<li local-id=3D"3a74e14b-cbe3-4e4f-8a46-ba31d727d8d7">
<p local-id=3D"f57009bc8683">Observability</p>
<ul local-id=3D"eef6226e-8778-493c-8ace-9d5758cf41ae">
<li local-id=3D"6dfa42c7-8976-434f-b52b-1424454de0c5">
<p local-id=3D"af1e3cbe0ae1">Monitoring</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"09d11839-34c1-4580-816f-3f1303962fba">
<p local-id=3D"b5ba7caf0aee">Logging</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"608d9d1242d4">
<p local-id=3D"ea2c204ab37a">Appropriate SLIs and SLOs</p></li>
</ul></li>
<li local-id=3D"d008dd4f-aaec-4fa3-abc8-86f06d556434">
<p local-id=3D"ae7c39d8bd88">Application</p>
<ul local-id=3D"ed664230-5c27-4bc8-a951-9764e5b6c31d">
<li local-id=3D"0cfb10ee-a876-4515-a4f7-01d5e43c08a4">
<p local-id=3D"48385421ea59">Functionality</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"371a7d23-5353-4b57-ae2a-de67fc4516d8">
<p local-id=3D"b31bb9f396e0">Architecture</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"ce3ca80da53a">
<p local-id=3D"d02a65eb14e5">Design</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"d17e055b-f29c-434c-af88-cf3c32273f27">
<p local-id=3D"b24bc1e2faf5">Security features</p></li>
</ul></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"2f7eae35b6c9">When describing the application bear in mind t=
hat architecture and how it meets non functional requirements are as import=
ant to describe as the application functionality, for the purpose of assess=
ment.</p>
<p local-id=3D"5cec1d7595f2">This should be <strong>limited to 20 pages </s=
trong>maximum.</p>
<h2 local-id=3D"c6f9e7219184" id=3D"id-4thYearProject-GuidelinesforFinalPro=
jectDocumentation-IndividualContributionDocument(25%)"><u>Individual Contri=
bution Document (25%)</u></h2>
<p local-id=3D"6485e87a132e">In this section students should provide detail=
s of the individual contribution they have made to the project. The documen=
ted needs to be completed individually by each student and contain these se=
ctions:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"6dea68237f1a">
<li local-id=3D"b2dc0348-3506-4e02-9241-fbbb29f660c4">
<p local-id=3D"b228243c6286">Section Implementation</p>
<ul local-id=3D"217e647d-6bb2-4d1f-b34d-7b9d99aecdd7">
<li local-id=3D"013bff5a-1860-42d5-8b1d-910ddaa6773a">
<p local-id=3D"835816ce40bf">Detailed description of the implementation of =
the sections of the project the student has worked on. Reference the sectio=
ns in the overview document being implemented. Include information about de=
tailed design, implementation, testing, results etc.</p></li>
</ul></li>
<li local-id=3D"f532bfa915f8">
<p local-id=3D"cc6fc46f20ee">Process Documentation</p>
<ul local-id=3D"11239170fa92">
<li local-id=3D"94640d349e2a">
<p local-id=3D"dd197726bdc4">Evidence of following an Agile process (e.g. S=
crum or Kanban) and capturing the process is an appropriate tool (e.g. Jira=
). Summarise the approach and provide details/export of the individual task=
s worked on in an appendix.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"d54145094185">
<p local-id=3D"f44208f9a5c7">Details of documentation worked on by the stud=
ent during the project, e.g. architecture design decisions, tool evaluation=
s etc. These documents should have been captured in an appropriate document=
ation tool (e.g. Confluence). Export these documents into an appendix and r=
eference in main document as appropriate.</p></li>
</ul></li>
<li local-id=3D"06ff69254eb1">
<p local-id=3D"3ab1e88a7386">Reflection</p>
<ul local-id=3D"aef7b27dabb0">
<li local-id=3D"62b78271c312">
<p local-id=3D"c2f52aecf3c7">What went well.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"c2ac34f9f4d5">
<p local-id=3D"39530a1eedb6">Issues, challenges and resolutions</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"16c896b64588">
<p local-id=3D"f0404aa34353">Benefits and valuable insights gained</p></li>
</ul></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"ca1acb90e2bf">This section should be <strong>limited to 30 p=
ages</strong>, not including appendices.</p>
<h2 local-id=3D"69687061c0c5" id=3D"id-4thYearProject-GuidelinesforFinalPro=
jectDocumentation-FinalPresentation(10%)"><u>Final Presentation </u>(10%)</=
h2>
<ul local-id=3D"147d43e668ce">
<li local-id=3D"cf5e7460972a">
<p local-id=3D"05ce3383af5e">Poster</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"06951553d339">
<p local-id=3D"41f5ceac1343">Demonstration of app</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"7c91805292b1">
<p local-id=3D"5a804041e3b2">High level description of platform</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"004bf0d1d70c">
<p local-id=3D"7838200fc9ca">Walkthrough of deployment process</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"0b9ec281b9ce"></p>
<h2 local-id=3D"6650e5e109d1" id=3D"id-4thYearProject-GuidelinesforFinalPro=
jectDocumentation-ReferencetoLearningOutcomes">Reference to Learning Outcom=
es</h2>
<p local-id=3D"dfd8eb3589e4">Please keep in mind when producing documentati=
on that projects are assessed against the Learning Outcomes for the module.=
 They are listed below for reference:</p>
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"604c2685bd23">
<li local-id=3D"e692c24390c1">
<p local-id=3D"b5922dc78dad">Conduct background reading, research and user =
analysis to develop a set of requirements and give wider context for a comp=
lex technical project.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"66c974709e59">
<p local-id=3D"af2ea2f56b37">Build, test and deploy a substantial artefact =
while demonstrating best practice in modern DevOps.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"314656b80355">
<p local-id=3D"5c3e294e8ccc">Demonstrate a thorough understanding of Develo=
pment, Configuration Management, Continuous Integration/Delivery (CI/CD) an=
d Operations including software tools used for automation.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"3c9bce48645a">
<p local-id=3D"41ce75e1fc5d">Communicate technical information clearly and =
succinctly using a range of media.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"30786bcbaddf">
<p local-id=3D"76c4b5d2fb98">Critically assess project outputs, reflecting =
on the extent to which the objectives of the project have been reached, and=
 discuss project outcomes in an oral/practical presentation.</p></li>
</ol>
<p local-id=3D"34d2e9018018"></p>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
